       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CMA7Q1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE
           ACCEPT WS-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED
           IF WS-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE = 'N' AND
              WS-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED = 'Y'
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION
           END-IF
           DISPLAY WS-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION
           STOP RUN.
